GITCAPI  CSECT
         ENTRY GITCAPI
         EXTRN GITNAPI
* GCCCMS R1 points to argument list; first word is API block.
* Preserve the C caller's R12 base across the assembler call.
         LR    0,12
         BALR  12,0
         USING *,12
         ST    0,SAV12
         ST    14,SAV14
         L     1,0(1)
         L     15,=V(GITNAPI)
         BALR  14,15
         L     14,SAV14
         L     12,SAV12
         BR    14
         LTORG
SAV12    DS    F
SAV14    DS    F
         END
